<title>NETHERLANDS: GUCCI GROUP POSTS RECORD  H1 PROFITS.</title>
<headline>GUCCI GROUP POSTS RECORD  H1 PROFITS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (dollars)		1.15 vs   0.59 (proforma)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    69.9  vs  26.4  (restated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (millions)		390.0  vs 206.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   104.7  vs  42.5</p>
<p>Note - Luxury goods maker Gucci said first half 1995 results</p>
<p>had been restated for a change in accounting principles. The</p>
<p>company, listed in Amsterdam and New York, said it was</p>
<p>encouraged by initial orders for its Spring 1997 collection, but</p>
<p>gave no firm profit forecast.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
